{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Compassionate, confidential therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Short-term and long-term work for anxiety, relationships, trauma, and life transitions." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="{{THERAPIST_NAME}}" class="brand-avatar" />
        <div class="brand-text">
          <strong class="business">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <span class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <button id="navToggle" class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button>
        <ul class="nav-list" id="navList">
          <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">How I Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Investment</a></li>
          <li><a href="faq.html">Questions</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="eyebrow">Therapy with intent</h1>
          <h2 class="headline">I help people in {{CITY}} and online move through overwhelm toward greater clarity.</h2>
          <p class="lede">I offer evidence-informed, compassionate therapy for anxiety, life transitions, relationship struggles, and trauma. Sessions are confidential, collaborative, and paced to your goals.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button id="leadMagnetBtn" class="btn btn-outline">Get a free worksheet</button>
          </div>
          <p class="meta">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="Illustration" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="values" class="section pale">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Core practice principles</h3>
        <div class="values-grid">
          <article>
            <h4>Respectful, evidence-informed care</h4>
            <p>I integrate empirically supported approaches while tailoring them to your context and pace. I won’t pathologize — I listen and collaborate.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h4>Privacy & clear boundaries</h4>
            <p>Sessions are confidential. I maintain clear scope and limits; I will discuss confidentiality, record-keeping, and consent at intake.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <h4>Practical focus</h4>
            <p>We balance insight with practical strategies you can use between sessions, with an eye toward functional goals that matter to you.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="methods" class="section dark">
      <div class="wrap methods">
        <h3 class="section-title light">How I work — methods I use</h3>
        <p class="section-lead light">I draw from a range of approaches and choose the fit based on your goals and needs.</p>
        <ul class="method-list">
          <li><strong>Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT)</strong> — strategy-focused skill building for anxiety and mood.</li>
          <li><strong>Trauma-Informed Care</strong> — stabilizing, grounding, and paced trauma processing when appropriate.</li>
          <li><strong>Emotion-Focused Work</strong> — helping you locate and work with patterns in relationships and self-regulation.</li>
          <li><strong>Relational Therapy</strong> — attention to interpersonal patterns and communication in partnerships and families.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="objections" class="section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Common concerns I hear</h3>
        <div class="objections-grid">
          <div>
            <h4>"I’m not sure therapy will work for me."</h4>
            <p>That’s understandable. We start by clarifying what you want to change and choose practical, measurable steps. Therapy is collaborative: we try things, check how they land, and adjust.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>"I don’t have time for weekly sessions."</h4>
            <p>We can discuss alternatives: short-term focused work, biweekly sessions, or a mix of sessions and structured between-session work tailored to your schedule.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>"I’m worried about confidentiality."</h4>
            <p>I prioritize client privacy. I will explain limits of confidentiality, data handling, and your rights before we begin so you can decide with clarity.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="testimonials" class="section pale">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title">Clients say</h3>
        <div class="testimonials">
          <blockquote>
            <p>"I learned tools I still use when anxiety surfaces. Sessions felt practical and compassionate."</p>
            <cite>— A., 34</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote>
            <p>"I appreciated the steady pace and clear boundaries. Progress felt real and sustainable."</p>
            <cite>— M., 42</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="lead_magnet" class="section dark small">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h3 class="section-title light">Free worksheet: Track a thought that keeps repeating</h3>
        <p class="light">A short one-page exercise to notice and reframe a recurring thought pattern. Delivered as a PDF.</p>
        <form id="leadForm" class="lead-form" aria-label="Download worksheet">
          <input type="email" id="leadEmail" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Send me the worksheet</button>
        </form>
        <p class="small muted">I respect your privacy. Your email will only be used to send the worksheet and occasional practice-relevant updates. You can unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="section callout">
      <div class="wrap callout-grid">
        <div>
          <h3>Ready to begin?</h3>
          <p>If you’re uncertain, a 20-minute consult can help us see fit and logistics. I offer both in-person work in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and telehealth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn btn-primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-outline">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap footer-grid">
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}}</p>
        <p><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Practice scope</h4>
        <p>My work is supportive psychotherapy for adults. I do not provide emergency services or medical advice. If you are in crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Privacy</h4>
        <p>Your information is kept confidential in accordance with professional ethical standards and applicable law. We will discuss limits of confidentiality during intake.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap fineprint">
      <p>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All content is for informational purposes. Not a substitute for professional advice or emergency services.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div id="modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog">
      <button id="modalClose" class="modal-close">Close</button>
      <div id="modalContent"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
